OL,3,AUS too focused on Middle East and not
OL,4,Apushing Russia hard enough, Zelensky
OL,5,Atells BBC
OL,6,
OL,7,FVolodymyr Zelensky has voiced deep
OL,8,Ffrustration with the US, saying that
OL,9,Fdelays in delivering vital
OL,10,Fanti-ballistic missiles are costing
OL,11,FUkrainian lives and complaining that
OL,12,Fthe US is not pushing Russia hard
OL,13,Fenough during peace talks.
OL,15,FIn an interview with the BBC at his
OL,16,Fcentral Kyiv office, Ukraine's
OL,17,Fpresident also said it was "strange"
OL,18,Fthat Donald Trump had posted a picture
OL,19,Fof himself embracing Vladimir Putin as
OL,20,F"my friend".
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
